%% Full-Stack HTTP Lifecycle: Browser Client → Express → PostgreSQL → Client
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor UI as UI / data hook
  participant API as Endpoint adapter
  participant HTTP as apiClient
  participant AUTH as Auth subsystem
  participant SERVER as Express route
  participant SERVICE as Service layer
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  UI->>API: Call typed endpoint function
  API->>HTTP: method(path, body, options)

  opt Authenticated request (default)
    HTTP->>AUTH: getValidToken()
    alt Token missing
      AUTH-->>UI: Throw AuthError
    else Token expired
      AUTH-->>UI: Open ReLoginModal
      UI->>AUTH: Re-authenticate
      AUTH-->>HTTP: Fresh access token
    else Token near expiry and cooldown elapsed
      AUTH->>SERVER: POST /auth/refresh<br/>(httpOnly cookie)
      alt Refresh succeeds
        SERVER-->>AUTH: Fresh access token
      else Refresh fails
        AUTH-->>UI: Clear auth data and navigate to /login
      end
    else Token valid
      AUTH-->>HTTP: Current access token
    end
  end

  HTTP->>SERVER: HTTPS request<br/>Authorization: Bearer …
  Note over HTTP,SERVER: rawFetch applies a 15-second timeout

  alt Network failure
    HTTP-->>UI: Throw NetworkError
  else Request timeout
    HTTP-->>UI: Throw RequestTimeoutError
  else Caller aborts request
    HTTP-->>UI: Rethrow AbortError
  else Request reaches Express
    SERVER->>SERVER: requestId → helmet → cors<br/>json → cookieParser

    alt Health route
      SERVER-->>HTTP: 2xx response
    else Auth route
      SERVER->>SERVER: authLimiter → asyncHandler
    else Public route
      SERVER->>SERVER: rate limiter → validation → asyncHandler
    else Protected route
      SERVER->>SERVER: authenticateToken → requirePermission<br/>rateLimiter → validateRequest → asyncHandler
    end

    opt Controller runs
      SERVER->>SERVICE: Call business operation
      SERVICE->>DB: Parameterized query / transaction
      DB-->>SERVICE: Rows or database error
      SERVICE-->>SERVER: Result or AppError
    end

    alt Successful response
      SERVER-->>HTTP: 2xx typed data
      Note over HTTP: 204/205 and empty successful bodies resolve as undefined
      HTTP-->>API: T
      API-->>UI: Update state / navigate / render
    else Protected request returns 401
      SERVER-->>HTTP: 401 error response
      HTTP->>AUTH: requestReAuth()
      AUTH-->>UI: Open ReLoginModal
      UI->>AUTH: Re-authenticate
      AUTH-->>HTTP: Re-authentication succeeded
      HTTP->>SERVER: Retry request once
      Note over HTTP,SERVER: Retry then follows the same success/error handling
    else Application or middleware error
      SERVER->>SERVER: handleError logs failure and prepares response
      SERVER-->>HTTP: 4xx / 5xx<br/>{ error, details?, requestId }
      HTTP-->>UI: Throw ApiError
    end
  end

  Note over UI,HTTP: UI catches errors with getErrorMessage(error, fallback)
